{
  "title": "Luscious Algerian Chicken Breast Tagine",
  "description": "A rich and juicy Algerian dish featuring chicken breast, perfect for a crowd, this recipe is a high-protein friendly option that is sure to please. It is made with a variety of spices and ingredients that give it a unique flavor.",
